/// SandboxesService is Sylphx Sandboxes: isolated machines leased for a bounded
/// time, granted immediately or refused with a typed reason, and wiped before
/// anyone else can touch them (docs/specs/one-platform/sandboxes-e2b.md). The
/// streaming guest protocol (process, filesystem, CDP, desktop) is served on
/// `{port}-{short_id}.sandboxes.sylphx.net`; the methods here are its request-
/// response subset.
